          en: '[[kazenbo|Kazenbo]], the flame specter, is burning its way down through the castle, and [[yamato|Yamato]] is running to reach the armory before it. When [[scratchmen-apoo|Apoo]] goes after him, Fuga bursts out of the chamber and chases them both. [[nico-robin|Robin]] and [[brook|Brook]], jumping to escape the fire, land on something soft: Fuga’s hair. Yamato greets him like an old friend and, when the specter comes down on them, shouts at him to run; then he asks for his help and takes him along, until Robin and Brook jump off to go their own way.',
