          en: 'Into the abyss, into the abyss, Kazenbo chants as it burns its way down through the castle, and pirates and samurai alike jump or run to keep from burning to death. It passes straight through the agents hunting [[nico-robin|Robin]]. In the treasure repository [[kurozumi-orochi|Orochi]] listens and gloats that the Kozuki bloodline will end. Then the fortress learns where the specter is heading: to the armory in the basement, where the stockpiled explosives would go up the moment it reached them.',
