          en: 'Pinned under the rubble of the treasure repository, [[kurozumi-orochi|Orochi]] begs [[kozuki-hiyori|Hiyori]] to set him free, and she refuses. Then a small wisp of flame rises through the floor, all that is left of Kazenbo: it has failed, it says, it is finished, and Orochi asks whether it is [[kanjuro|Kanjuro]]. Delighted, he offers it a new stage and orders it to burn Hiyori alive. The specter turns instead and comes straight at him. Not to me, Orochi screams, and the fire takes hold of him.',
